{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生の中川智尋です！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mob44fB7e.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "水族館のメリーゴーランド"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "イルカに乗りました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "他にもアトラクションがあって"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "東京の水族館すごすぎるー！って驚いちゃった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "イルカショーもみれて、まんぞくまんぞく♩"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobQtCZ4X.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "エイが魚界でいちばんすきです！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほわーって包み込んでくれそう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そうそう、くらげもいました"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "プカプカたくさん浮いてた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "くらげといえば……！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツアーで披露させていただきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「くらげらしく」🪼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobnVjVoZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好きな憧れのおふたりと、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "パフォーマンスできて嬉しかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初日公演は、全員くらげヘアでした〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここでツアーの前回載せきれてなかった"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "思い出写真たちを📸"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobbm49HD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "I will be披露前のささやきボイスが大好きで"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたしもBuddiesと一緒に叫びそうになってました！( Ö )"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobrHTOgw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "和子から、瞳月さんにリクエストした髪型してもらえた！と自慢されてぐぬぬ😶となったので、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつか私もリクエストさせてください…( ･̆ ･̆ )"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobVmitDW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽屋でうどん脳を抱きしめて寝ている的野さん"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とっても可愛かったです！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずるいぞうどん脳〜〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お知らせ(  . .)\""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「6th YEAR ANNIVERSARY LIVE」のファンクラブ抽選先行・Leminoスペシャルシート先行・Lemino櫻坂46パック先行受付が始まりました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はじめてのZOZOマリンスタジアム！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドキドキです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6周年をBuddiesのみなさんとお祝いできること、とっても幸せです！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会場でお会いできる日を楽しみにしています🍀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "16th Single『愛MUST BE』発売記念 オンラインミート＆グリートの1次受付が始まりました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハロウィンの日はナースか猫さん"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最終日はサンタさんになろうかな 𐄑𐅁̂ ⩊፟ ̂𐅀𐄑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "他の日は絶賛迷い中…"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "受付は明日までです！まってるね"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobCwXu3g.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この子と目が合って嬉しかった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}], "source": "official"}